+' @desc P13 텍스트섹션/빈 표시 키 프로브만 단독 실행함(UnivFilter 리뷰 실측)
+Public Sub RunP13Only()
+    Dim prevScreen As Boolean
+    prevScreen = Application.ScreenUpdating
+    On Error GoTo Fail
+    Application.ScreenUpdating = False
+    LogShim.Reset
+    Set mRows = New Collection
+    P13_TextSectionKey
+    WriteGapReport
+    LogShim.LogEvent "gap_done", Array("rows"), Array(mRows.Count)
+Cleanup:
+    Application.ScreenUpdating = prevScreen
+    Exit Sub
+Fail:
+    LogShim.LogD "error", "RunP13Only: " & Err.Number & " " & Err.Description
+    Resume Cleanup
+End Sub
